network SecretModel ⟦
    dense ⟬2⸴ 4⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬4⸴ 1⟭ ·
⟧

process main ⦅ ⦆ → int64 ⟦
    ethical_boundary auth ⟦
        rule user_authorized ↦ 1.0 ·
    ⟧

    vault v ⟬ SecretModel ⟭ threshold ↦ 3 ·

    // Seal weights
    seal v ·
    emit "Weights sealed in vault" ·

    // Unseal authorized
    unseal v with auth ·
    emit "Weights unsealed for inference" ·

    // Emergency wipe
    wipe v ·
    emit "Vault wiped" ·

    yield 0 ·
⟧

